---
description: Testing and evaluation rules
globs: tests/**, evals/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- pytest with pytest-asyncio. Unit tests mock network and LLM calls with recorded fixtures in `tests/fixtures/`. No live API calls in unit tests.
- Integration tests run against Docker Postgres and are marked `@pytest.mark.integration`.
- Each component has a contract test that checks its public surface against its node Contract.
- Evals live in `evals/`: `labelled_claims.jsonl` (judge agreement), `planted_falsehoods.jsonl` (catch rate), `red_team.jsonl` (satire, stale, injection). Report precision, recall, catch rate, and cost.
- Record headline eval numbers in `context/nodes/editor.md` and `context/STATE.md` after each run.
